 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "When Job prayed for his friends he stood",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Lord restored his fortunes to his hand",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He gave him twice as much as before",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A new beginning after the war",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His brothers and sisters came to his door",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They ate in his house and felt the floor",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They consoled him over the trouble he saw",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Giving pieces of silver and gold rings to draw",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He named the first Jemimah",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The second Keziah",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the third Keren-happuch",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A beauty that is much",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Nowhere in all the land were they found",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Women as beautiful without a sound",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In Job's daughters the light did break",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With an inheritance for their sake",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He named the first Jemimah",
